## **11. Sub-agents / Delegation**

### **Multi-Agent Pattern via Tool**:

`invokeBedrockAgent` tool ([InvokeBedrockAgentTool.ts](reference/bedrock-engineer/src/preload/tools/handlers/bedrock/InvokeBedrockAgentTool.ts#L50-L100)):
- Agent A calls Agent B via Bedrock agent invocation
- Passes input text + optional file attachment
- Receives session ID (for stateful conversation)
- Result returns message + generated files

### **Shared Agent Catalog** ([agent-handlers.ts](reference/bedrock-engineer/src/main/handlers/agent-handlers.ts#L1-L50)):
- Shared agents stored as YAML/JSON in `.bedrock-engineer/agents/`
- Loaded on-demand via `loadSharedAgents()` IPC handler
- Each agent is `CustomAgent` with system prompt + tool config

### **No hierarchical orchestration**:
- Agents are siblings (not tree-structured)
- Coordination via message passing (tool results)

